WEBVTT

00:01:56.333 --> 00:02:00.133
I see... I had no idea all of that
happened to Jibral.

00:02:01.166 --> 00:02:02.296
My Lord...

00:02:04.633 --> 00:02:10.273
B-But... I'm glad we were at least able to
save Conrad and the others. Right, Shu?

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:13.830
Huh?
Y-Yeah...

00:02:14.766 --> 00:02:17.466
What do you intend on
doing now, Conrad?

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:21.370
Go...west.

00:02:22.566 --> 00:02:28.166
As long as there are people who
will oppose Nene, Jibral lives on.

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:32.770
I will travel across the country
to unite those people

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:34.800
and challenge Nene
one more time...

00:02:34.833 --> 00:02:38.173
No, I will keep fighting the Grankingdom
as long as it takes.

00:02:38.733 --> 00:02:41.573
There is no other path for me.

00:02:42.566 --> 00:02:47.466
THE INFORMANT'S PURSUIT

00:02:53.533 --> 00:02:56.073
So what do we do now?

00:02:56.633 --> 00:03:00.603
Until Conrad and his men are ready,
we're stuck here.

00:03:01.333 --> 00:03:05.833
Once they're ready, we'll part with them
and head to the next ruins.

00:03:06.033 --> 00:03:08.273
So we're not going to go with them?

00:03:08.666 --> 00:03:11.066
We are not soldiers,

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:14.330
and the more people we have,
the slower we'll be.

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:16.970
We can't do anything about that.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:17.670
Maro...

00:03:18.866 --> 00:03:20.966
We don't have to wait for Homeron?

00:03:21.266 --> 00:03:23.366
He's a first-class master informant.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:31.030
No matter where we are,
he'll use his network and find us.

00:03:31.366 --> 00:03:34.366
I hope he can come back safely...

00:03:35.566 --> 00:03:36.226
It'll be ok.

00:03:38.833 --> 00:03:41.033
Homeron is an exceptional man.

00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:46.233
No matter what kind of adversity
he may face, he will pull through.

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:04.330
According to the data,
the computer room is ahead of here.

00:04:13.333 --> 00:04:18.133
During that battle,
it was the prison camp that was infiltrated.

00:04:19.666 --> 00:04:23.696
But, why did they target
that prison camp?

00:04:25.166 --> 00:04:29.096
Rescuing the Knight Master Conrad
is not a futile effort.

00:04:29.966 --> 00:04:35.596
That alone is sure to raise the spirits of
Jibral's allies and revitalize their forces.

00:04:37.733 --> 00:04:41.533
But the way they fought bothers me...

00:04:42.766 --> 00:04:46.566
It was as if they're trying to
appeal their presence...

00:04:47.633 --> 00:04:52.673
Normally, if someone were trying to
rescue a prisoner, they'd do so covertly.

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:59.670
As a result, the reinforcements
were sent from the nearby base.

00:05:00.266 --> 00:05:07.096
In other words, the Grankingdom's attention
was all focused on the prison camp...

00:05:14.966 --> 00:05:15.966
I see...

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.300
So that's what it is...

00:05:26.233 --> 00:05:30.403
This is the computer floor,
and from here on,

00:05:30.433 --> 00:05:35.173
there're several layers of
security systems to keep out intruders.

00:05:42.166 --> 00:05:44.266
First, the camera.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:52.130
I'm depending on you,
Illusion Bug.

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:13.170
In the end, security systems
mean nothing once I get a crack at it.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:16.030
I'm moving forward
without any hesitation.

00:06:29.866 --> 00:06:30.896
What's going on?

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.170
Yes!

00:06:32.433 --> 00:06:35.203
I've come here from
the control room with an order.

00:06:35.733 --> 00:06:38.033
It seems a security camera's
making strange noises.

00:06:38.233 --> 00:06:41.803
Camera? What does that
have to do with us?

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.070
You should just leave that
to the technology division.

00:06:45.366 --> 00:06:47.626
Yes, I know but...

00:06:50.100 --> 00:06:52.670
I actually have some business
with you guys!

00:06:58.833 --> 00:07:02.273
I disabled your central nervous system.

00:07:02.666 --> 00:07:06.196
Now your lives are
in the palm of my hand...

00:07:08.366 --> 00:07:13.226
You guys won't be able to move,
speak or even close your eyes...

00:07:13.666 --> 00:07:15.866
Unless you have my permission.

00:07:16.433 --> 00:07:17.833
So don't resist.

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:23.770
You guys are my prisoners.
My obedient...prisoners.

00:07:28.866 --> 00:07:31.566
Swear to me.
Give me your allegiance.

00:07:31.866 --> 00:07:34.826
- Yes. We are your prisoners...
- Yes. We are your prisoners...

00:07:37.166 --> 00:07:37.826
Good boys.

00:07:42.666 --> 00:07:44.226
Castillo De La Testa...

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:48.900
There's a computer terminal
in that base that can access

00:07:48.933 --> 00:07:51.873
the master computer back in
Grankingdom's central command.

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.930
You're good... Homeron.
However...

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:59.370
It seems like you went too far...

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:01.400
This game is over.

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:07.970
Before you learn any more,
I will finish you off.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:24.670
Working quite hard, huh,
Captain Gilliam?

00:08:25.466 --> 00:08:29.726
I can't believe we're doing
surveillance work on a hot day like this.

00:08:29.933 --> 00:08:33.833
We should let the machines
take care of stuff like this!

00:08:34.466 --> 00:08:39.666
We can't depend on machines!
You guys should already know that too!

00:08:39.866 --> 00:08:43.426
That's true. They're useless in reality.

00:08:43.466 --> 00:08:46.096
But why surveillance work?

00:08:46.933 --> 00:08:51.273
You know about the prisoner's camp
that got blown up a few hours ago, right?

00:08:51.433 --> 00:08:52.103
Yes.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:53.500
So what is the matter?

00:08:53.866 --> 00:08:56.226
Those Shadow Wielders did it.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:09:00.400
And Cynthia and Lemaire
were involved in that battle...

00:09:01.566 --> 00:09:04.296
Don't you think it's
a chance to get ahead?

00:09:05.733 --> 00:09:08.033
That may be true, but...

00:09:08.533 --> 00:09:11.373
I don't want to waste time or effort.

00:09:11.733 --> 00:09:14.333
Don't worry. I have a good hunch.

00:09:15.866 --> 00:09:18.196
Those guys are moving
with exhausted prisoners,

00:09:18.233 --> 00:09:20.003
so they won't be able to get too far.

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:26.100
And there is almost no place for a group
with that many people to hide in this area...

00:09:26.533 --> 00:09:27.533
I see...

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:29.370
Point M345...

00:09:30.333 --> 00:09:32.433
That's right... The Forest of Rove.

00:09:32.966 --> 00:09:36.696
We're having Andropov attack
from the opposite direction.

00:09:37.266 --> 00:09:39.126
If we can attack from both ends...

00:09:39.366 --> 00:09:40.596
The Shadow Wielders...

00:09:40.900 --> 00:09:41.900
And the escaped prisoners...

00:09:42.466 --> 00:09:44.096
Wiped out in one attack.

00:09:55.533 --> 00:09:58.203
One, two, three.

00:10:23.066 --> 00:10:27.096
Good work.
Go back to your usual duty.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:29.270
- Yes, understood.
- Yes, understood.

00:10:29.666 --> 00:10:34.726
But don't let anybody pass unless
I give my permission. Also...

00:10:35.033 --> 00:10:38.203
If anything happens,
forget everything about me.

00:10:38.733 --> 00:10:39.733
You got that?

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:41.800
- Yes, understood.
- Yes, understood.

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:42.970
Now then...

00:11:03.366 --> 00:11:07.426
A pressure sensor...
How impressive.

00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:31.900
Now...

00:11:32.733 --> 00:11:34.603
This is where
the real challenge begins.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:50.270
Battle?
It's not my concern.

00:11:54.866 --> 00:11:58.526
Oh, they're here!
They've come just as we expected!

00:11:58.566 --> 00:12:02.266
Just like Zola said!
It was worth waiting!

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:05.070
One, two, three...

00:12:06.133 --> 00:12:07.903
There are three Shadow Wielders.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:12.170
There're three of us too.
We won't let them pass through here.

00:12:12.466 --> 00:12:14.426
Everybody, let's go, maro!

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:53.370
Listen. Just like Zola said, we have to
get them before they enter the forest!

00:12:53.666 --> 00:12:54.666
- Right!
- Right!

00:12:58.366 --> 00:12:59.366
That guy?!

00:12:59.433 --> 00:13:01.233
Yes, from before.

00:13:01.266 --> 00:13:05.096
That's it? That's all?

00:13:05.133 --> 00:13:06.473
Maro!

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.500
- What?!
- What?!

00:13:11.533 --> 00:13:16.373
Sorry but there's only three of us here,
so we'll use the prisoners as our shield!

00:13:23.533 --> 00:13:24.803
Charge!

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:34.970
To access Grankingdom's
master computer,

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:38.700
I'd need an ID card and left hand
fingerprint from a top official.

00:13:39.233 --> 00:13:41.933
Or an access code and
an access permission application

00:13:41.966 --> 00:13:44.026
saying that I'm on
a special mission...

00:13:44.233 --> 00:13:46.303
If you can't get any of those things,

00:13:46.333 --> 00:13:49.573
you will need to hack
the four firewalls and destroy it.

00:13:52.633 --> 00:13:53.673
First one...

00:14:05.466 --> 00:14:06.126
Clear.

00:14:10.566 --> 00:14:11.226
Second one...

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:15.470
Clear.

00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:18.670
Third one...

00:14:21.766 --> 00:14:22.426
Clear.

00:14:30.266 --> 00:14:31.296
Access granted.

00:14:34.033 --> 00:14:35.403
Connecting to database.

00:14:37.166 --> 00:14:38.826
The guardian of the Extra Seven...

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:43.000
In order for her to have that much mobility
and ability to take action independently,

00:14:43.033 --> 00:14:44.833
there must be an explanation.

00:14:45.933 --> 00:14:50.133
In other words, there must be some
kind of big organization backing her.

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:53.500
She's able to operate
not only in Jibral

00:14:53.533 --> 00:14:57.103
but even out in Korin and Metia
and regions beyond.

00:14:58.333 --> 00:15:04.133
If my hunch is correct,
she's an agent of Grankingdom.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:12.030
Pull data on Extra Seven,
and the activity surrounding it.

00:15:16.366 --> 00:15:17.366
No data.

00:15:18.566 --> 00:15:22.696
Then, data on any research record of
the Shadow and the research facility.

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:27.270
Nothing...

00:15:28.666 --> 00:15:33.626
There is no research on the Extra Seven
done in the Grankindgom?

00:15:36.333 --> 00:15:38.573
Show the list of agents.

00:15:41.800 --> 00:15:45.170
There's too many.
This will take too long...

00:15:45.833 --> 00:15:49.833
But, this is strange that there is
no information on the Extra Seven

00:15:49.866 --> 00:15:52.096
on the Grankingdom's computer...

00:15:53.133 --> 00:15:55.873
Could it be that I've miscalculated?

00:15:56.666 --> 00:15:59.696
But I can't think of any other organization
that could've pulled this off...

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:02.270
Have I reached a dead end?

00:16:09.933 --> 00:16:12.273
Who are you?
Are you a military personnel?

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:13.570
Show your pass.

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:16.270
If you don't have it,
we'll have to ask you to leave.

00:16:16.733 --> 00:16:19.933
Leave? That's something
you can't ask of me.

00:16:33.133 --> 00:16:36.073
Hipopon, Hipotama, Transform!

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:40.170
Hipo, I will transform! Yes!

00:16:40.966 --> 00:16:41.626
Everybody!

00:16:41.933 --> 00:16:43.403
Quick! Get inside!

00:16:46.066 --> 00:16:47.526
Damn Grankingdom!

00:16:49.966 --> 00:16:51.796
I won't forgive you!

00:16:52.266 --> 00:16:53.726
We didn't finish things before.

00:16:54.066 --> 00:16:57.326
So let's settle this now.
In a fair and square fight!

00:16:57.500 --> 00:17:02.300
Fair and square?
A battle is always ruthless!

00:17:02.766 --> 00:17:04.396
Feather Storm!

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:15.470
Both our Shadows may have speed,
but my Euphir can fly!

00:17:16.266 --> 00:17:19.996
I'll use this advantage effectively!

00:17:26.000 --> 00:17:27.070
Maro!

00:17:28.833 --> 00:17:31.073
We're just an easy target
for our enemy like this.

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:34.200
There!

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:38.130
Crushing Nail!

00:17:44.033 --> 00:17:45.573
Blue Dragon!

00:17:49.333 --> 00:17:50.933
Don't give up, Marumaro!

00:17:51.266 --> 00:17:51.926
Maro!

00:17:52.366 --> 00:17:54.126
I won't give up no matter what!

00:17:55.166 --> 00:17:57.026
But at this rate...

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.570
Marumaro! Hey...

00:17:58.733 --> 00:17:59.403
Maro?

00:18:05.533 --> 00:18:08.303
If I give up now,
Shu is going to laugh at me.

00:18:12.533 --> 00:18:16.033
If a straight forward approach doesn't work,
then I'll just have to change my tactic.

00:18:16.600 --> 00:18:18.870
The day the Extra Seven
was stolen...

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:22.270
factor in military maneuvers
around Jibral Castle...

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.200
Filtering results to
secret missions only...

00:18:28.066 --> 00:18:32.466
Three matches.
Salinas, Delphinium, and Norg.

00:18:33.666 --> 00:18:34.296
That's it.

00:18:36.466 --> 00:18:38.566
Homeron... No more!

00:18:39.833 --> 00:18:41.973
Who are you?! Stop!

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.170
Nevermind, shoot!

00:19:12.266 --> 00:19:13.396
The ventilation shaft.

00:19:14.533 --> 00:19:15.603
Enemy!

00:19:15.766 --> 00:19:17.626
An intruder in the computer room!

00:19:19.200 --> 00:19:20.970
Looks like I overdid myself.

00:19:37.633 --> 00:19:38.803
Where's the intruder?!

00:19:39.033 --> 00:19:40.033
I don't know.

00:19:40.466 --> 00:19:42.696
By the time I arrived,
there was no one.

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:45.970
Spread out!
They couldn't have gone far!

00:19:46.933 --> 00:19:48.403
So that woman really was...

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:51.000
Ray Stinger!

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:57.500
They're too fast!

00:19:57.833 --> 00:20:01.073
Unless we catch them,
we can't fight!

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:02.900
So quick!

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:05.770
Don't complain. Aim well.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:10.470
Conquer!

00:20:29.000 --> 00:20:29.670
Use it.

00:20:31.100 --> 00:20:32.570
You need that, don't you?

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:35.470
Whoops.

00:20:40.300 --> 00:20:41.300
There.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:49.370
It's just as I thought, these Shadows
aren't used to aerial battles.

00:20:49.766 --> 00:20:50.926
In that case...

00:20:50.966 --> 00:20:53.096
I don't know about that!

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:55.170
What?!

00:20:57.766 --> 00:20:59.526
A makeshift tactic won't work!

00:21:03.466 --> 00:21:05.066
We're counting on you, Marumaro!

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:10.400
There!

00:21:11.666 --> 00:21:13.266
Feather Protect!

00:21:16.966 --> 00:21:18.096
Not just yet!

00:21:18.566 --> 00:21:19.226
What?!

00:21:20.366 --> 00:21:21.366
Oh no!

00:21:22.033 --> 00:21:23.673
Saber Tiger!

00:21:26.966 --> 00:21:29.266
Blitz Claw!

00:21:34.733 --> 00:21:35.733
Captain!

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:37.930
Where are you looking at?!

00:21:38.266 --> 00:21:39.266
What?!

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:42.730
You let your guard down,
Grankingdom foot soldier!

00:21:50.866 --> 00:21:52.396
What is Andropov doing?!

00:21:52.633 --> 00:21:55.333
Damage in the yellow zone,
the gap in forces is increasing.

00:21:55.533 --> 00:21:56.733
I suggest withdrawal.

00:21:56.966 --> 00:21:58.396
Andropov, you!

00:21:59.000 --> 00:22:00.570
Take your subordinates and withdraw.

00:22:00.633 --> 00:22:06.633
I recommend you rebuild your force.
If you keep going, you will lose, Gilliam.

00:22:07.333 --> 00:22:08.333
Damn you!

00:22:08.766 --> 00:22:12.396
I'll let you decide.
This is just a suggestion.

00:22:19.033 --> 00:22:20.473
All right!

00:22:36.933 --> 00:22:38.933
I'm closing in on you now...

00:22:42.566 --> 00:22:43.566
Delphinium.

00:24:21.566 --> 00:24:23.466
Cynthia is jealous of Bouquet's beauty.

00:24:23.566 --> 00:24:26.226
Putting her womanly pride on the line,
they battle it out.

00:24:26.666 --> 00:24:29.666
It'll be all right.
I'm good at strip game.

00:24:29.733 --> 00:24:32.103
Yeah, but... Oh, Bouquet!

00:24:32.133 --> 00:24:35.273
No matter who wins,
it's great for me.

00:24:35.966 --> 00:24:38.896
Next on Blue Dragon:
Vanish Vanish Don't!
